  "description": {
   "en": "*All-rush* is a film production term to describe the roughly edited footage from shooting all the scenes. By watching it, the production team can check the whole basic structure and flow of the story, which enables them to improve the quality of the film during the editing process.\n\n*All-rush* also gives a sense that the shooting is almost complete, and answers the question of: how is the film coming together?\n\nDoes the story make sense? Do the visuals work? This is a story of an average man producing a movie.\n___\n**Alt Official Raw:** [niconico Manga](https://manga.nicovideo.jp/comic/35649)"
  },
